  unitName: "Millia (7\u2605)"
  unitId: 840377
  unitNumber: 8302
  description: A former assassin from another world. Millia uses her locks infused
    with forbidden magic to slice up her enemies in battle without wasting any time.
    Having joined the Assassin's Guild from a very young age, she was forced to learn
    how to fight on a regular basis, but acted with great indifference towards most
    things regardless. However, she ultimately betrayed the Guild on her first mission,
    and began to be persecuted by the organization. Forced to exchange blows with
    the leader of the Assassin's Guild, who was also her former lover, she realized
    that she had nothing to fear, and finally gained her freedom...
  summonDesc: ...Can I help you?<br>Please make it quick.<br>I need to be somewhere.
  fusionDesc: You're impressive.<br>I think you could be fun. Why don't you entertain
    me for a bit?
  evoDesc: 
